participants: Client, Payments, DB, Provider
Client -> Payments: POST /payments (Idempotency-Key)
Payments -> DB: insert CREATED + outbox
Payments --> Client: 202 accepted
Payments -> Provider: charge (key = payment id)
Provider --> Payments: timeout
Payments -> DB: state UNKNOWN
== recovery ==
Payments -> Provider: lookup by payment id
Provider --> Payments: captured
Payments -> DB: SUCCEEDED + ledger + outbox
